# dayOfMonth

- _dayOfMonth(d)_

Answer the ordinal (one-indexed) day of month of date _d_.

```
>>> Date(1970, 1, 1).dayOfMonth
1

>>> '2024-03-04'.parseDate.dayOfMonth
4
```

* * *

See also: asDate, Date, minute, month, parseDate, year

